0/qZLDqf9poquJwY5uY6ZWK1yqsSb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7i70dfvEXuV6o7nN9J8P4KCM6K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Northern England, 1912. The dinner of a wealthy family is interrupted by Inspector Goole, who only announces that a young woman has committed suicide. Then, he simply asks everyone present, one by one, if they knew her.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13551,\"title\":\"The Dead Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wBIn93ZY0Qd3BafjSJYvqgAZu88.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/20z5l7CEwg8aXcHhxfgk2qxlv1f.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The clues to a young woman's death come together as the lives of seemingly unrelated women begin to intersect.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1235742,\"title\":\"VICE News Presents: 'Epstein Didn't Kill Himself'\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/km1bnJeV1TiOX8w8oeHtRnnbUhK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bhywi9m4XMkmpuHfHYj988uVK6S.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"How the mysteries surrounding Jeffrey Epstein’s life and death gave rise to a conspiracy theory that will never die.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2165,\"title\":\"Liberty Stands Still\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itFpp5ZvdrhrFB7PwFcaWevwdyb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2deGCpB6Ta27cnndJKWgCd1TW4t.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As the heir and current marketing director for one of the nation's biggest gun manufacturers, Liberty Wallace is indifferent to the atrocities made possible through her business and her CEO husband, Victor. On her way to see her actor lover, Liberty ends up chained to a food cart full of explosives -- all at the insistence of \\\"Joe\\\", a sniper whose young daughter was a victim of gun violence, and who now has Liberty in his sights.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":457926,\"title\":\"Kessler's Lab\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4qPYGjal1tndA5ISnyZdB0kLxYT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4omcyZ4fd4rkYCVam6f00ytf5uL.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kessler's lab was created to run drug trials to determine what went wrong with a once popular mood stabilizing drug. Dr. Martin Kessler cloned his own daughter, who died from the drug. Once with ten test subjects, he and Dr Josephine Vanderhill are now left with only a few dying, sick clones, and one healthy placebo, Jenny. Daniel Powell runs the day to day operations and tends to the clones, administering the very drug that is killing them. When Dr. Kessler unexpectedly dies, instead of shutting down the facility, Dr Vanderhill wants to intensify the testing. She targets Jenny, and convinces Daniel to administer the pills in highly concentrated doses, sure to be fatal. Now conflicted, Daniel is determined to stop her and save the clones.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"u36N25kTMz4\",\"name\":\"Annika Bengtzon: Deadline (Trailer)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}